# Angelic Destiny: with the Aura spell on the stack aimed at Bot1's Grizzly Bears, Bot2 destroys the Bears in response with Terror
# (a Mox Jet and a Swamp). The Aura has no legal target and is countered on resolution (CR 608.2b), so it goes to the graveyard: it was
# never on the battlefield enchanting the creature, so it never triggers and is not returned to hand (the 2011-09-22 ruling).

